WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.279 --> 00:00:10.460
If you have a 10 number password,

2
00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:13.720
then with software with the cryptographic calculation

3
00:00:13.729 --> 00:00:15.579
to brute force attack your environment,

4
00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:17.780
it will take five seconds to crack.

5
00:00:21.579 --> 00:00:23.520
Most people think eight characters with

6
00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:25.879
multiple different characters is pretty secure

7
00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:28.559
and that's kind of standard for password requirements.

8
00:00:28.819 --> 00:00:32.869
But if someone really wants it, it may take them 35 days,

9
00:00:32.889 --> 00:00:34.720
we'd rather be more secure than that.

10
00:00:37.439 --> 00:00:41.380
If you have 16 characters with one upper case and one special character.

11
00:00:41.389 --> 00:00:42.279
For example,

12
00:00:42.299 --> 00:00:44.590
this is more secure because you have

13
00:00:44.599 --> 00:00:47.619
upper and lower case characters and special characters

14
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:51.860
to crack this, it will take about 152,000 years.

15
00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:57.069
So just by following a good password policy and appropriate procedures,

16
00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:59.869
